# DsAutocomplete docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsAutocomplete
  onInputValueChange={() => {}}
  onOpenChange={() => {}}
  onValueChange={() => {}}
  options={[
    {
      label: 'Apple',
      value: 'apple'
    },
    {
      label: 'Banana',
      value: 'banana'
    },
    {
      label: 'Cherry',
      value: 'cherry'
    }
  ]}
  placeholder="Select or type to search..."
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsAutocomplete
    placeholder="Select or type to search..."
    options={[
        { value: 'apple', label: 'Apple' },
        { value: 'banana', label: 'Banana' },
        { value: 'cherry', label: 'Cherry' },
    ]} />;

